### Backend (consolidated)
# Python caches, virtual envs, IDE and env files inside Backend/
Backend/__pycache__/
Backend/*.py[cod]
Backend/*$py.class
Backend/.Python
Backend/.venv/
Backend/venv/
Backend/ENV/
Backend/env/
Backend/build/
Backend/dist/
